// [의사코드] 저장된 배치·반입 명세를 따라 모델/시각 배치와 검수 결과를 재현한다.
// [코딩]
// 의사코드: 실제 저장 씬을 재열고 돔 안팎 렌더와 벽 충돌을 확인한 뒤 검수 상태를 복원한다.
using System;using System.IO;using System.Linq;using System.Collections.Generic;using System.Reflection;using UnityEngine;using UnityEditor;using UnityEditor.SceneManagement;using Newtonsoft.Json;using Newtonsoft.Json.Linq;
public static class FinalReview {
 public static string Pod(){var scene=EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(PlacementSession.Scenes.First(s=>s.Contains("B5")));var all=PlacementSession.All(scene);var cc=all.SelectMany(t=>t.GetComponents<CharacterController>()).Single();var rs=cc.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>(true).Where(r=>r.enabled).ToArray();foreach(var r in rs)r.enabled=false;try{PlacementSession.Render(scene,"B5_pod_exterior.png",new Vector3(3.5f,2.2f,6.9f),new Vector3(0,1.55f,10.45f),false);PlacementSession.Render(scene,"B5_pod_inside.png",new Vector3(0,1.825f,10.8f),new Vector3(0,1.65f,7.3f),false);}finally{foreach(var r in rs)r.enabled=true;}
 Physics.SyncTransforms();var origin=new Vector3(0,1.55f,10.45f);var rays=new List<object>();for(int i=0;i<16;i++){var dir=Quaternion.Euler(0,i*22.5f,0)*Vector3.forward;var hits=Physics.RaycastAll(origin,dir,3,~0,QueryTriggerInteraction.Ignore).Where(h=>h.collider!=cc).OrderBy(h=>h.distance).ToArray();bool dome=hits.Length>0&&PlacementSession.P(hits[0].transform).Contains("/ObservationPod/");rays.Add(new{angle=i*22.5f,hit=dome,distance=hits.Length>0?hits[0].distance:-1,path=hits.Length>0?PlacementSession.P(hits[0].transform):"none"});if(!dome)throw new Exception("Dome has a collision gap");}
 var center=cc.transform.TransformPoint(cc.center);var capsuleBottom=center-Vector3.up*(cc.height*.5f-cc.radius);var capsuleTop=center+Vector3.up*(cc.height*.5f-cc.radius);var spawnOverlaps=Physics.OverlapCapsule(capsuleBottom,capsuleTop,cc.radius,~0,QueryTriggerInteraction.Ignore).Where(c=>c!=cc).Select(c=>PlacementSession.P(c.transform)).ToArray();if(spawnOverlaps.Length>0)throw new Exception("Spawn overlaps "+string.Join(",",spawnOverlaps));
 var initial=cc.transform.position;var moveTests=new List<object>();try{for(int i=0;i<8;i++){cc.enabled=false;cc.transform.position=initial;cc.enabled=true;Physics.SyncTransforms();var dir=Quaternion.Euler(0,i*45f,0)*Vector3.forward;CollisionFlags flags=0;for(int j=0;j<70;j++)flags|=cc.Move(dir*.05f);var pos=cc.transform.position;float radial=new Vector2(pos.x,pos.z-10.45f).magnitude;moveTests.Add(new{angle=i*45,radial=radial,flags=flags.ToString(),stopped=radial<1.12f});if(radial>1.12f)throw new Exception("Controller escaped dome during collision check");}}finally{cc.enabled=false;cc.transform.position=initial;cc.enabled=true;Physics.SyncTransforms();}
 File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(PlacementSession.Work,"pod_physics_review.json"),JsonConvert.SerializeObject(new{spawnOverlaps=spawnOverlaps,rays=rays,controllerMoves=moveTests,note="Editor geometry check of the existing CharacterController; gameplay escape/interaction not implemented"},Formatting.Indented));EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(scene.path);return "Pod outside/inside renders captured; spawn clear, 16 wall rays and 8 CharacterController directions stopped";}
 public static string Extras(){var scene=EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(PlacementSession.Scenes.First(s=>s.Contains("1F")));PlacementSession.Render(scene,"1F_exterior_assets.png",new Vector3(10,7,-35),new Vector3(0,1.5f,-28.5f),false);scene=EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(PlacementSession.Scenes.First(s=>s.Contains("B2")));PlacementSession.Render(scene,"B2_machinery_assets.png",new Vector3(-1.5f,1.9f,3),new Vector3(4.6f,1.4f,5),false);PlacementSession.Render(scene,"B2_pit_grating.png",new Vector3(1,2.8f,1),new Vector3(0,-2.6f,-1.5f),false);EditorSceneManager.OpenScene(PlacementSession.Scenes.First(s=>s.Contains("B5")));return "Additional machinery and background views captured";}
 public static object ConsoleStatus(){var type=AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies().Select(a=>a.GetType("Unity.Pipeline.Runtime.Commands.ConsoleCommand")).FirstOrDefault(t=>t!=null);return type.GetMethod("Status",BindingFlags.Static|BindingFlags.Public|BindingFlags.NonPublic).Invoke(null,null);}
}
// 주석: 검수 카메라와 이동은 저장하지 않는다. 원래 시작 Transform과 Renderer 상태로 복원한다.

// [주석] 검수 자료의 작업 순서와 최신 경로표를 확인한 뒤 사용한다.
